# GraphOne AI Intelligence Pipeline

## Overview

This project is built for the GraphOne / FrontierAtlas AI Data Intelligence Internship Assessment.

The pipeline collects structured AI intelligence from multiple public sources including research papers, startups, products, jobs, and news.

## Features

* Research Paper Scraper (arXiv)
* GitHub Metrics Extraction
* AI Startup Dataset
* AI Product Dataset
* AI News Scraper
* AI Jobs Scraper (Greenhouse API)
* Entity Resolution Engine

## Tech Stack

* Python
* Pandas
* Requests
* Feedparser
* BeautifulSoup
* aiohttp

